<title>USA: Harris Cty MUD 222, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</title>
<headline>Harris Cty MUD 222, Texas, won by A.G. Edwards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.G. Edwards &amp; Sons said it won $1.960 million of Harris Cty MUD 222, Texas, general obligation bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.588 percent.</p>
